  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"548\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"113\">Flamengo</strong> is a premium wellness brand focused on recovery, performance, and self-care. We design high-quality products like infrared sauna blankets, ice baths, massage tools, and compression therapy – trusted by athletes, biohackers, and wellness lovers across Europe.<br data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"375\"><strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"390\">Our mission</strong>: to help people get the most out of life by combining deep recovery, modern design, and high performance – bringing the spa experience into your home or gym.</p><hr data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"553\"><h3 data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"587\">• <strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"585\">Product Description:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"655\">Our collection includes one carefully developed model per category:</p><ul data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"1033\"><li data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"761\"><p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"761\"><strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"684\">Infrared sauna blanket</strong> – full-body coverage, deep FIR heat (up to 75°C), and luxurious PU leather</p></li><li data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"841\"><p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"841\"><strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"776\">Ice bath</strong> – premium insulated model with optional chiller and filtration</p></li><li data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"899\"><p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"899\"><strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"864\">Mini massage gun</strong> – compact, powerful, and stylish</p></li><li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"969\"><p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"917\">Massage mat</strong> – foldable infrared mat for targeted massage heat therapy</p></li><li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1033\"><p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1033\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"997\">Air compressi